th that fixed, defecting is the dominant choice and I'd submit. I briefly considered that the two inputs might be equivalent up to renaming, but I'll follow the essay's literal recipe and go with that.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm looking at the twin prisoner's dilemma with different observations, where the question is whether the other copy's F_y depends on F_x under the essay's siblings-held-fixed assumption. I'm also weighing how to draw the edge criterion when the other copy computes its decision on input y.\n\nI'm treating the other copy's decision as a sibling held at its prior, so with that fixed, defecting is the dominant choice and I'd submit. I briefly considered that the two inputs might be equivalent up to renaming, but I'll follow the essay's literal recipe and go with that.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9595,"completion_tokens":725,"total_tokens":10320,"cost":0.05288,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05288,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03838,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0145},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":281,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}